 "notes": [
  "Hand-written held-out requests for the decision 'which plan, if any, does this part get' on the bundled library example (fix-o1lg S0).",
  "Disjoint from every seed utterance of the library's commands and from library.json and library_handwritten.json in this folder (tests/test_plan_intent_fixture.py checks it).",
  "context is where the workflow stands: Library is the root record; Book is the book b1 inside it.",
  "expect is plan (expected names the planning command), execution (expected names the plain command that answers it; no plan may be given) or none (nothing in the workflow serves it; no plan may be given).",
  "group names the case's group: plan, execution, resembles_plan (a plain command answers it, but its wording resembles a planning command's description) or none.",
  "two_part requests carry their parts as a split would write them, each with its own expectation; the scorer scores each part."
 ],
